{"id":"wb-5-243","name":"太符观","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"太符观","text":"太符观位于中国山西省汾阳市杏花村镇上庙村，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n太符观建于金承安五年（1200年），现存建筑中大殿为金代原构，余为明代所建。整体建筑坐北朝南，南北长177.5米，东西宽50米，有两进院落，由南至北有照壁、牌楼、倒座戏台（下层为山门，两侧有关帝庙、二郎殿）、昊天玉皇上帝殿（两侧有后土圣母殿、五岳殿）等建筑。大殿即昊天玉皇上帝殿，面阔进深均为三间，单檐歇山顶，殿内有明代塑像。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E7%AC%A6%E8%A7%82","revisionId":86089128,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86089128","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3ecfe393478b2892923246f7.jpg","title":"太符观-3.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%AA%E7%AC%A6%E8%A7%82-3.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/%E5%A4%AA%E7%AC%A6%E8%A7%82-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Fymking","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： CNSX-358-004","width":320,"height":214,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata P373 专属相册：Taifu Guan","categorySourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Taifu_Guan"}}